golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85e19	en	Search Tips: wildcard	Use an * for wildcard search. Ie: "juris*" will match words  such as jurisdiction, jurisdictional, jurists, jurisprudence, etc.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85e1a	en	Search Tips: one char wildcard	? for one character wildcard. Ie: "198?" will match 1980 to 1989 and also 198a, 198b, etc.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85e1b	en	Search Tips: exact term	Exact term match by enclosing your search string with quotes. Ie. "Costa Rica" will toss different results compared to Costa Rica without quotes.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85e1c	en	Search Tips: proximity	~ for proximity searches. Ie: "the status"~5 will find anything having "the" and"status" within a distance of 5 words, such as "the procedural status", "the specific legal status".	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85e1d	en	Search Tips: boolean	AND, OR and NOT for boolean searches. Ie. "status AND women NOT Nicaragua" will match anything containing both the words status and women, and necessarily not containing the word Nicaragua.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
