golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f09	en	Uploading ...	Uploading ...	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f0a	en	This template will be used as default for new entities.	This template will be used as default for new entities.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f0b	en	Filters configuration description	By default, users can filter the entities in the library based on the types you have defined. However, you can configure how these entity types will be displayed:	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f0c	en	Filters configuration example	select "Create group" below to group filters under a label e.g ("Documents "or "People")	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f0d	en	Entity types	Entity types	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f0e	en	If it is an external URL, use a fully formed URL. Ie. http://www.uwazi.io.	If it is an external URL, use a fully formed URL. Ie. http://www.uwazi.io.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f0f	en	Navigation menu tool tip part 1	If it is an internal URL within this website, be sure to delete the first part	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f10	en	Navigation menu tool tip part 2	leaving only a relative URL starting with a slash character. Ie. /some_url.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f11	en	Add group	Add group	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f12	en	Metadata Extraction	Metadata Extraction	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f15	en	Landing page description	The landing page is the first page that visitors see when they come to your collection. The default landing page is your collection's library. You can set a different landing page by adding its relative URL here. For example:\n      \nA page: */page/dicxg0oagy3xgr7ixef80k9*\nA filtered view in Uwazi: */library/?searchTerm=test*\nAn entity: */entity/9htbkgpkyy7j5rk9*\nA document: */document/4y9i99fadjp833di*\n      \nImportant: You must use relative URLs. These start with a forward slash and do not include the domain name. For example: In the address *https://yoursite.com/landingpage*, the relative URL is /landingpage	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f16	en	Favicon description	A favicon is a small icon that represents your collection in browser tabs and bookmarks. The default favicon is the Uwazi logo. To use your own:\n\n1. Upload your icon in Custom Uploads.\n2. Copy its URL.\n3. Choose "Custom Icon" and paste the URL in the indicated field.\n4. Reload the page to see your favicon in action.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f18	en	Contact email description	Here you can set up the contact email and the email that appears when Uwazi sends a notification to a user	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f19	en	Receiving email description	If you have a contact form, this is the email address that will receive the form's submissions.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f1a	en	Sending email description	This is the email address that will appear as the sender when an email is sent from your Uwazi collection to registered users. The default address is *no-reply@uwazi.io*. You can set a custom one by including your desired email address here.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f1b	en	Character support description	This option enhances support for non-Latin languages as the default languages of your collection.\nSelecting this option will update all template properties automatically. The process could take several minutes. Selecting this option will likely change the URLs of library filters. As a consequence, if you have menus or links using such URLs, they will probably stop working.\nYou will need to update them manually. After selecting this option, you will not be able to revert back to using legacy property naming. If you are not facing issues with your template property names, we recommend leaving this unchecked.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f1c	en	Character support process warning	This process could take several minutes and will likely change URLs to library filters. If you have menus or links using such URLs, they will probably stop working after the update. You will need to update them manually.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f1d	en	Character support revert warning	After selecting this option, you will not be able to revert back to using legacy property naming. If you are not facing issues with your template property names, we recommend leaving this unchecked.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f1e	en	Analytics description	If you want to track analytics related to your collection visits, Uwazi supports both Google Analytics and Matomo.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f1f	en	Set the default starting point for your geolocation properties.	Set the default starting point for your geolocation properties.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f20	en	Public form settings description	Here you can configure the public form destination and the whitelisted templates	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f21	en	Public form URL description	If you have configured a public form and would like a different Uwazi collection to receive the submissions, enter its URL here.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f22	en	Public form whitelist description	If you wish to include Public Forms on your pages, you must white-list the template IDs for which Public Forms are expected.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f23	en	Properties from other templates in the collection using the same label	Properties from other templates in the collection using the same label	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
