golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f37	en	Priority sorting	Priority sorting	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f38	en	Priority sorting description	Properties marked as priority sorting will be used as default sorting criteria. If more than one property is marked as priority sorting the system will try to pick-up the best fit. When listing mixed template types, the system will pick-up the best combined priority sorting.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f39	en	Property as filter description	This property will be used for filtering the library results. When properties match in equal name and field type with other entity types, they will be combined for filtering.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
golden	6747017d337142d8a6a85f3a	en	Property as default filter description	Use this property as a default filter in the library. When there are no entity types selected, this property will show as a default filter for your collection.	System	Uwazi UI	User Interface
